=\"col-price tabular-nums\">$632.59</td>\n          <td class=\"col-1h tabular-nums text-green\">+0.38%</td>\n          <td class=\"col-24h tabular-nums text-green\">+1.89%</td>\n          <td class=\"col-7d tabular-nums text-green\">+4.98%</td>\n          <td class=\"col-mcap tabular-nums\">$85.27B</td>\n          <td class=\"col-vol tabular-nums\">$1.95B</td>\n          <td class=\"col-supply tabular-nums\">134.78M BNB</td>\n          <td class=\"col-chart text-green\">▃▃▄▅▆</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"col-rank\">6</td>\n          <td class=\"col-name text-left\"><strong>Dogecoin (DOGE)</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"col-price tabular-nums\">$0.34</td>\n          <td class=\"col-1h tabular-nums text-red\">-0.12%</td>\n          <td class=\"col-24h tabular-nums text-green\">+1.05%</td>\n          <td class=\"col-7d tabular-nums text-green\">+2.15%</td>\n          <td class=\"col-mcap tabular-nums\">$49.11B</td>\n          <td class=\"col-vol tabular-nums\">$2.12B</td>\n          <td class=\"col-supply tabular-nums\">144.14B DOGE</td>\n          <td class=\"col-chart text-green\">▂▃▃▅▆</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"col-rank\">7</td>\n          <td class=\"col-name text-left\"><strong>Solana (SOL)</strong></td>\n          <td class=\"col-price tabular-nums\">$88.25</td>\n          <td class=\"col-1h tabular-nums text-green\">+0.67%</td>\n          <td class=\"col-24h tabular-nums text-green\">+3.74%</td>\n          <td class=\"col-7d tabular-nums text-green\">+5.67%</td>\n          <td class=\"col-mcap tabular-nums\">$50.77B</td>\n          <td class=\"col-vol tabular-nums\">$6.71B</td>\n          <td class=\"col-supply tabular-nums\">575.26M SOL</td>\n          <td class=\"col-chart text-green\">▂▃▄▅▆</td>\n        </tr>\n        <!-- JS will populate remaining rows up to 100 -->\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <div class=\"pagination-wrapper\" id=\"pagination\">\n      <div class=\"page-info\">Showing 1–100 of 8,364 assets</div>\n      <div class=\"page-numbers\">\n        <button class=\"page-btn active\" onclick=\"switchPage(this)\">1</button>\n        <button class=\"page-btn\" onclick=\"switchPage(this)\">2</button>\n        <button class=\"page-btn\" onclick=\"switchPage(this)\">3</button>\n        <button class=\"page-btn\" onclick=\"switchPage(this)\">4</button>\n        <span class=\"page-dots\">...</span>\n        <button class=\"page-btn\" onclick=\"switchPage(this)\">84</button>\n        <button class=\"page-btn\" onclick=\"nextPage()\">Next ❯</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Market Summary -->\n  <section class=\"market-summary container\">\n    <h2>Market Summary</h2>\n    <div class=\"summary-content\">\n      <p>The global crypto market cap is <strong class=\"text-dark\">$2.56T</strong>, a <strong class=\"text-green\">1.47% increase</strong> over the last day. The total crypto market volume over the last 24 hours is <strong class=\"text-dark\">$156.9B</strong>, a <strong class=\"text-green\">14.51% increase</strong>. The total volume in DeFi is currently $12.2B, 7.78% of the total crypto market 24-hour volume. The volume of all stablecoins is $195.53B, representing 124.63% of total 24-hour volume. Bitcoin's dominance is currently <strong class=\"text-dark\">59.04%</strong>, a decrease of 0.05% over the day.</p>\n      <div class=\"summary-extra hidden\" id=\"summaryExtra\">\n        <p>Ethereum dominance sits at 11.23%. The top gainers in the ecosystem over the past 24 hours highlight significant traction in emerging layer-1 solutions and AI-focused tokens. Total Value Locked (TVL) across all protocols reached $84.5B, reflecting steady inflows into decentralized applications and yield-bearing instruments.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button id=\"btnReadMore\" class=\"read-more\" onclick=\"toggleReadMore()\">Read More</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Info Content -->\n  <section class=\"info-content container\">\n    <div class=\"info-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <h3>Today's Cryptocurrency Prices, Charts and Data</h3>\n        <p>Welcome to CoinTracker Pro! Founded to provide up-to-date cryptocurrency prices, charts, and data about the emerging cryptocurrency markets. We take our data seriously and stand for accurate, timely, and unbiased information.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h3>All Your Crypto Market Data Needs in One Place</h3>\n        <p>CoinTracker Pro ensures all relevant information about cryptocurrencies, coins, and tokens can be located in one easily discoverable place.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h3>Live and Historic Crypto Charts for Free</h3>\n        <p>Each coin data page features graphs showing current and historic price information. Professional traders can access our API, enabling millions of calls to track current and historic prices.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h3>How Do We Calculate Cryptocurrency Prices?</h3>\n        <p>We receive updated prices directly from exchanges based on their trading pairs, then convert to USD.</p>\n        <h3>How Do We Calculate Crypto Valuations?</h3>\n        <p>Valuations are based on total circulating supply multiplied by the currency reference price.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"container footer-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <h4>Products</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Cryptocurrencies</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Exchanges</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">DexScan</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Portfolio</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Watchlist</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Company</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">About</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Terms of Use</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Methodology</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Disclaimer</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Support</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">FAQ</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Glossary</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Crypto Learning Center</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">API Documentation</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h4>Community</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Twitter</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Telegram</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Discord</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"#\">Instagram</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container footer-bottom\">\n      <p>© 2025 CoinTracker Pro. All rights reserved.</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script>\n    // Generate Rows 8 to 100\n    const tbody = document.querySelector('#cryptoTable tbody');\n    const chartSymbols = ['▂▃▄▅▆', '▁▂▃▅▆', '▃▃▄▅▆', '▂▃▃▅▇', '▅▅▅▅▅', '▆▅▄▃▂'];\n    for (let i = 8; i <= 100; i++) {\n      let tr = document.createElement('tr');\n      let price = (Math.random() * 500).toFixed(2);\n      let p1h = (Math.random() * 2 - 1);\n      let p24h = (Math.random() * 10 - 4);\n      let p7d = (Math.random() * 20 - 8);\n      let mcap = (Math.random() * 10 + 1).toFixed(2);\n      let vol = (Math.random() * 2).toFixed(2);\n      let sup = (Math.random() * 900 + 10).toFixed(2);\n      let chart = chartSymbols[Math.floor(Math.random() * chartSymbols.length)];\n      \n      let c1h = p1h >= 0 ? 'text-green' : 'text-red';\n      let c24h = p24h >= 0 ? 'text-green' : 'text-red';\n      let c7d = p7d >= 0 ? 'text-green' : 'text-red';\n      let p1hStr = p1h >= 0 ? '+' + p1h.toFixed(2) + '%' : p1h.toFixed(2) + '%';\n      let p24hStr = p24h >= 0 ? '+' + p24h.toFixed(2) + '%' : p24h.toFixed(2) + '%';\n      let p7dStr = p7d >= 0 ? '+' + p7d.toFixed(2) + '%' : p7d.toFixed(2) + '%';\n\n      tr.innerHTML = `\n        <td class=\"col-rank\">${i}</td>\n        <td class=\"col-name text-left\"><strong>CryptoCoin ${i} (CC${i})</strong></td>\n        <td class=\"col-price tabular-nums\">$${price}</td>\n        <td class=\"col-1h tabular-nums ${c1h}\">${p1hStr}</td>\n        <td class=\"col-24h tabular-nums ${c24h}\">${p24hStr}</td>\n        <td class=\"col-7d tabular-nums ${c7d}\">${p7dStr}</td>\n        <td class=\"col-mcap tabular-nums\">$${mcap}B</td>\n        <td class=\"col-vol tabular-nums\">$${vol}B</td>\n        <td class=\"col-supply tabular-nums\">${sup}M CC${i}</td>\n        <td class=\"col-chart ${p7d >= 0 ? 'text-green' : 'text-red'}\">${chart}</td>\n      `;\n      tbody.appendChild(tr);\n    }\n\n    // Carousel\n    let promoIndex = 0;\n    const promos = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-item');\n    function showPromo(index) {\n      promos.forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));\n      promos[index].classList.add('active');\n    }\n    function nextPromo() {\n      promoIndex = (promoIndex + 1) % promos.length;\n      showPromo(promoIndex);\n    }\n    function prevPromo() {\n      promoIndex = (promoIndex - 1 + promos.length) % promos.length;\n      showPromo(promoIndex);\n    }\n    setInterval(nextPromo, 5000);\n\n    // Dropdowns\n    function toggleDropdown(id) {\n      const dropdown = document.getElementById(id);\n      dropdown.classList.toggle('hidden');\n    }\n    document.addEventListener('click', function(event) {\n      const isClickInsideFilters = document.getElementById('btnFilters').contains(event.target) || document.getElementById('filtersDropdown').contains(event.target);\n      const isClickInsideCols = document.getElementById('btnColumns').contains(event.target) || document.getElementById('columnsDropdown').contains(event.target);\n      \n      if (!isClickInsideFilters && !document.getElementById('filtersDropdown').classList.contains('hidden')) {\n        document.getElementById('filtersDropdown').classList.add('hidden');\n      }\n      if (!isClickInsideCols && !document.getElementById('columnsDropdown').classList.contains('hidden')) {\n        document.getElementById('columnsDropdown').classList.add('hidden');\n      }\n    });\n\n    // Category and Network Tabs (State Change Simulation)\n    function switchCategory(btn) {\n      document.querySelectorAll('#categoryTabs .tab-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\n      btn.classList.add('active');\n      reorderTable();\n    }\n    function switchNetwork(btn) {\n      document.querySelectorAll('#networkTabs .tab-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\n      btn.classList.add('active');\n      reorderTable();\n    }\n    function reorderTable() {\n      // Simulate changing table data by moving rows around\n      const rows = Array.from(tbody.querySelectorAll('tr:not(.index-row)'));\n      rows.sort(() => Math.random() - 0.5);\n      rows.forEach((row, i) => {\n        row.querySelector('.col-rank').textContent = i + 1;\n        tbody.appendChild(row);\n      });\n    }\n\n    // Pagination (State Change Simulation)\n    function switchPage(btn) {\n      document.querySelectorAll('.page-numbers .page-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));\n      btn.classList.add('active');\n      window.scrollTo({ top: document.querySelector('.table-section').offsetTop - 100, behavior: 'smooth' });\n      reorderTable();\n    }\n    function nextPage() {\n      let current = document.querySelector('.page-numbers .page-btn.active');\n      let next = current.nextElementSibling;\n      if(next && next.tagName === 'BUTTON') {\n        switchPage(next);\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Read More Accordion\n    function toggleReadMore() {\n      const extra = document.getElementById('summaryExtra');\n      const btn = document.getElementById('btnReadMore');\n      if (extra.classList.contains('hidden')) {\n        extra.classList.remove('hidden');\n        btn.textContent = 'Read Less';\n      } else {\n        extra.classList.add('hidden');\n        btn.textContent = 'Read More';\n      }\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
